@@ -0,0 +1,283 @@
+// Copyright 2026 Kim2091 (Sparkles)
+// Portions Copyright (c) 2025-2026 CattaRappa (sambow23), softsoundd, Owen Krisch, BrunchyChineapple, Jerran Schmidt
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 AND MIT
